# 17. Counterfactual Failure Attribution

## 17.1 MVP 원칙

Task마다 `primary_blocker` 하나만 평가.

복합 blocker는 최소화.

## 17.2 공통 함수

```text
rerun_with_repaired_dimension(task, dimension, mode)
```

dimension:

- retrieval
- version
- schema
- privacy
- readability

## 17.3 Decision Flow

```text
TASK FAIL
 │
 ├─ required source 없음
 │      └─ missing_data
 │
 ├─ retrieval repair → PASS
 │      └─ retrieval_failure
 │
 ├─ version repair → PASS
 │      └─ version_ambiguity
 │
 ├─ schema repair → PASS
 │      └─ schema_mismatch
 │
 ├─ privacy repair → PASS
 │      └─ privacy_block
 │
 ├─ readability repair → PASS
 │      └─ unreadable_source
 │
 └─ 모두 FAIL
        └─ agent_failure
```

Failure classification은 코드가 수행하고, LLM은 자연어 설명만 담당한다.

