# 18. LLM 호출 예산

Mini benchmark에서 측정:

- avg LLM calls/task
- avg tool calls/task
- avg input tokens
- avg output tokens
- avg latency

최종 예상식:

```text
tasks
× conditions
× repetitions
× avg_calls_per_task
```

Counterfactual diagnosis:

- 각 task의 최초 1회에 대해서만 수행
- diagnostic result cache

Cache:

- retrieval result
- parsed document profile
- table profile
- diagnostic result
- repaired fixture

Budget policy:

```text
80% 도달 → repetition 3→2
95% 도달 → P1 / non-critical rerun 중단
```

